  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 545
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 在此之前，{FirstName}{称呼1}不但驱除外忧，还救下门中长老，请从混元仙体丹一枚，水龙牙两枚或是百万灵石之间任选其一，作为{FirstName}{称呼1}解决门派危机的报酬。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114809832762635131}
  AvatarIntID: 1
